    "answer": {
      "short": "$r^2-r\\le x\\le r^2+r$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}-1&\\le \\frac{x}{r}-r\\le 1\\\\r-1&\\le \\frac{x}{r}\\le r+1\\\\r^2-r&\\le x\\le r^2+r\\end{align*}$$\n\nMultiplication by $r>0$ preserves the inequality signs.",
